---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — GetFOSS"
  description="Learn how GetFOSS handles information and protects your privacy."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="content-shell">
    <article class="prose">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lede">Your privacy matters. GetFOSS is designed to provide information about free and open-source software without unnecessary tracking.</p>
      </header>

      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 26, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS ("we", "our", or "the website") is a website dedicated to free and open-source software. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected when you visit <a href="https://www.getfoss.org/">www.getfoss.org</a> and how that information is handled.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS does not require visitors to create accounts or provide personal information to browse the website.</p>
      <p>Our hosting provider, GitHub Pages, may process technical information such as IP addresses, browser details, and request logs as part of delivering the website and maintaining service security.</p>

      <h2>3. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS uses browser local storage to remember your selected color palette. This preference is stored on your device.</p>
      <p>The website does not intentionally use advertising cookies or third-party analytics cookies.</p>

      <h2>4. Website Search</h2>
      <p>Our search functionality is powered by Pagefind. Search runs in your browser using the website's static search index. Search queries are not intentionally sent to an external search service.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The website is hosted using GitHub Pages. When you visit the website, GitHub may process technical information according to its own privacy policies.</p>
      <p>Links to external websites and social networks are provided for convenience. When you follow those links, the privacy policies of the respective services apply.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS does not maintain user accounts or a personal information database. Technical logs, if processed by the hosting provider, are subject to that provider's retention practices.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights concerning your personal information, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion. For privacy-related questions, contact us using the address below.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when website features or applicable requirements change. The latest version will always be published on this page.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@getfoss.org">info@getfoss.org</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
